            "detailed_description": "<h1>MY NEXT GAME + DEMO</h1><p></p><br><h1>Acerca do jogo</h1>Prepare for a thrilling pirate adventure in Pixel Piracy! This is a Pirate Simulator Game. Assemble a skilled crew, construct a formidable ship, and embark on a perilous journey across the vast seas in search of legendary treasures and untold riches.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/264140/extras/39da2d9df3dbf4e7ad70526b76018971.poster.avif?t=1703187003\" width=600 height=260 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/264140/extras/39da2d9df3dbf4e7ad70526b76018971.webm?t=1703187003\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/264140/extras/39da2d9df3dbf4e7ad70526b76018971.mp4?t=1703187003\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>Manage your resources wisely, recruit capable sailors, and navigate through dynamically generated worlds teeming with dangerous creatures and rival pirates. Customize your ship's layout, upgrade its weaponry, and adapt to the challenges that lie ahead.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/264140/extras/d0d6d364f1119648f5a2ac50d80a7dc0.poster.avif?t=1703187003\" width=600 height=266 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/264140/extras/d0d6d364f1119648f5a2ac50d80a7dc0.webm?t=1703187003\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/264140/extras/d0d6d364f1119648f5a2ac50d80a7dc0.mp4?t=1703187003\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>Unleash your strategic prowess as you engage in intense naval battles, explore uncharted islands, and interact with diverse civilizations. Unlock powerful abilities, gather valuable loot, and cement your legacy as the ultimate pirate captain in this immersive open-world experience.",
            "about_the_game": "Prepare for a thrilling pirate adventure in Pixel Piracy! This is a Pirate Simulator Game. Assemble a skilled crew, construct a formidable ship, and embark on a perilous journey across the vast seas in search of legendary treasures and untold riches.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/264140/extras/39da2d9df3dbf4e7ad70526b76018971.poster.avif?t=1703187003\" width=600 height=260 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/264140/extras/39da2d9df3dbf4e7ad70526b76018971.webm?t=1703187003\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/264140/extras/39da2d9df3dbf4e7ad70526b76018971.mp4?t=1703187003\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>Manage your resources wisely, recruit capable sailors, and navigate through dynamically generated worlds teeming with dangerous creatures and rival pirates. Customize your ship's layout, upgrade its weaponry, and adapt to the challenges that lie ahead.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/264140/extras/d0d6d364f1119648f5a2ac50d80a7dc0.poster.avif?t=1703187003\" width=600 height=266 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/264140/extras/d0d6d364f1119648f5a2ac50d80a7dc0.webm?t=1703187003\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/264140/extras/d0d6d364f1119648f5a2ac50d80a7dc0.mp4?t=1703187003\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>Unleash your strategic prowess as you engage in intense naval battles, explore uncharted islands, and interact with diverse civilizations. Unlock powerful abilities, gather valuable loot, and cement your legacy as the ultimate pirate captain in this immersive open-world experience.",
